bffUHHWpeBz8Q3IcHCJgCKBQ",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwiz_emUwdKWAxXbffUHHWpeBz8Q3IcHCJkCKBU",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_DISH_RECOMMENDATION"],"你推薦哪道料理？",null,[[[["M:/g/11l0nngjg5"],"麵體",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiz_emUwdKWAxXbffUHHWpeBz8Q3YcHCJsCKAA"],[["M:/g/11s5v06t52"],"羊西菜",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiz_emUwdKWAxXbffUHHWpeBz8Q3YcHCJwCKAE"],[["M:/g/11swjz6ht3"],"招牌湯麵 豚骨魚介 濃",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiz_emUwdKWAxXbffUHHWpeBz8Q3YcHCJ0CKAI"]],[1]],null,"建議的餐點",null,"0ahUKEwiz_emUwdKWAxXbffUHHWpeBz8Q3IcHCJoCKBY",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_GROUP_SIZE"],"這裡適合幾個人的聚會？",null,[[[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_ONE"],"1 人",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiz_emUwdKWAxXbffUHHWpeBz8Q3YcHCJ8CKAA"],[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_TWO"],"2 人",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiz_emUwdKWAxXbffUHHWpeBz8Q3YcHCKACKAE"],[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_THREE_TO_FOUR"],"3 到 4 人",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiz_emUwdKWAxXbffUHHWpeBz8Q3YcHCKECKAI"]]],null,"用餐人數",null,"0ahUKEwiz_emUwdKWAxXbffUHHWpeBz8Q3IcHCJ4CKBc",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["京都拉麵名店「餘香sugari」在海外的第一家分店，2012年開幕轉眼也在台灣經營13年了，仍然人氣不減，晚上熱門時段有時還是需要候位！\n麵屋緣主打「醫食同源」的理念，自製全麥麵和天然魚介湯頭都令人驚豔，在台北算是特別的口味，很有自己的特色，另外還有辣柚味噌(冬季限定)、柚子冷麵/番茄沾麵(夏季限定)等特色拉麵，不過京都本店招牌的牛內臟拉麵這裡似乎沒有。\n豚骨魚介拉麵(300元)好吃必點！店家自製的全麥麵有點類似蕎麥麵，但麵體非常Q彈，麥味又非常濃厚，可說是結合了拉麵和蕎麥麵的優點。魚介湯頭比起五之神，鹹度明顯有配合台灣口味調低，入口鮮味濃厚，微酸微鹹的口感完全不膩口，整碗喝完也完全無負擔，真的太厲害！叉燒部分也不錯，炙燒的口感挺好，不過肉量不多，但光是麵和湯頭兩樣拉麵的靈魂就非常出色👍\n另外加點部分，羊栖菜(70元)是清爽甘甜的漬物口感，吃起來像細條狀的海帶，相較日本口味鹹度也有調低。\n最後一定要來個黑糖黃豆優格(80元)，綿密的優格吃起來像帶酸味的豆花，要拌一下再吃，讓甜味和黃豆香味滲入，做一餐完美收尾！",null,[0,178]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14538826069739229445/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnR3TkZWcVVsbE5SMFpXWTIxT01sa3hXbFZaVmtFMFlsVk9hR0ZYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14538826069739229445/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnR3TkZWcVVsbE5SMFpXWTIxT01sa3hXbFZ